  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.57 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Professional Bondsmen",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.57 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Professional Bondsmen. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.56, below, shall apply to the registration of professional bondsmen under RSA 598-A:\n\nTable 1002.57 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Registration of Professional Bondsmen\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nProfessional bondsman registration application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of registration | 2 years | $160\n\nSource. #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
